{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04607","headline":"奉和圣制初入秦川路寒食应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制初入秦川路寒食应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上阳柳色唤春归，临渭桃花拂水飞。\n总爲朝廷巡幸去，顿教京洛少光辉。\n昨从分陕山南口，驰道依依渐花柳。\n入关正投寒食前，还京遂落清明後。\n路上天心重豫游，御前恩赐特风流。\n便幕那能镂鸡子，行宫善巧帖毛球。\n渭桥南渡花如扑，麦陇青青断人目。\n汉家行树直新丰，秦地骊山抱温谷。\n香池春溜水初平，预欢浴日照京城。\n今岁随宜过寒食，明年陪宴作清明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}